{"id":8867094986951,"title":"Cat Quilt Set - Cat Patchwork Style Printed Bedding, Animal Patchwork","handle":"cat-quilt-set-cat-patchwork-style-printed-bedding-animal-patchwork","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the rustic charm of the countryside with this Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, designed to bring a cozy and timeless look to your bedroom. Featuring classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics, this quilt set offers warmth and tradition, making it an ideal gift for loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Elegance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Adorn your bedroom with a farmhouse quilt featuring classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless aesthetic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size or adding pillowcases and a custom name.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e This farmhouse quilt is available in multiple sizes: Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91'').\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e A perfect gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for family members like mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, or daughter.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e This microfiber quilt is machine washable; simply wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for fluffier results.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e The set includes 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ct